{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"density-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer","detected_language":"fr","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"density-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer","keys":["density-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer"],"locale":"fr","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"L’outil divise la masse totale par le volume total et suppose que les volumes des composants sont additifs. Les mélanges réels peuvent se rétrécir, se dilater, se dissoudre ou contenir des vides, de sorte que le volume final mesuré est plus précis lorsque cela est important.","record_id":"c86d754a0e1bfe6b87f9d1d45d10997e04a72bd68d416db0da7cc7f9081ce4c7","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":1.7489579699999922,"source":"Enter each component’s mass and volume on its own line. The tool divides total mass by total volume and assumes the component volumes are additive. Real mixtures may shrink, expand, dissolve or contain voids, so measured final volume is more accurate when that matters.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"25ccd26c48b5799c491ef1e6d713a516262e5f868a5ee18a9aa003fc5b646eb3","status":"machine-draft","translation":"L’outil divise la masse totale par le volume total et suppose que les volumes des composants sont additifs. Les mélanges réels peuvent se rétrécir, se dilater, se dissoudre ou contenir des vides, de sorte que le volume final mesuré est plus précis lorsque cela est important.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
