{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"options-profit-calculator UI copy.fields.riskNote","detected_language":"fr","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"options-profit-calculator.copy.fields.riskNote","keys":["options-profit-calculator.copy.fields.riskNote"],"locale":"fr","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Il s’agit d’un résultat théorique à l’expiration d’une seule tranche, et non d’un rendement, d’un cours ou d’une recommandation de transaction attendus. Il exclut la valeur temporelle avant l’expiration, les commissions, l’écart entre les prix acheteur et vendeur, les taxes, la marge, les dividendes, l’exercice anticipé et la cession.","record_id":"c853d959ecfa57d4c8b0b6d89b70f89e0ac6cc8903e15a2e8221619a0471d939","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40658885003","seconds":2.3185802887498994,"source":"This is a theoretical single-leg result at expiration—not an expected return, quote or trade recommendation. It excludes time value before expiration, commissions, bid/ask spread, taxes, margin, dividends, early exercise and assignment. A short call can have theoretically unlimited loss.","source_commit":"eb6b1a93248bb554a61ee97166d91f6524e72a78","source_hash":"65d3a81140052f0f13566887ccb0acef4d463df9f13c45190124035950c52552","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Il s’agit d’un résultat théorique à l’expiration d’une seule tranche, et non d’un rendement, d’un cours ou d’une recommandation de transaction attendus. Il exclut la valeur temporelle avant l’expiration, les commissions, l’écart entre les prix acheteur et vendeur, les taxes, la marge, les dividendes, l’exercice anticipé et la cession.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
